       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. NUMBER-TABLE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 NUMBER-IN PIC 9(3).
       01 COUNTER PIC 9(3).
       01 PRODUCT-VALUE PIC 9(6).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "Enter a number: " WITH NO ADVANCING.
           ACCEPT NUMBER-IN.
           PERFORM VARYING COUNTER FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL COUNTER > 10
               MULTIPLY NUMBER-IN BY COUNTER GIVING PRODUCT-VALUE
               DISPLAY NUMBER-IN " x " COUNTER " = " PRODUCT-VALUE
           END-PERFORM.
           STOP RUN.
